      "ticket_type": "upsell",
      "decision": "answered",
      "reply": "Hi Diego, thanks for asking. Pro Monthly is 79 US dollars a month. It includes everything in Starter, plus a weekly group coaching call, the template library, and one project review a month. Starter gives you the course library, member forum and one live Q&A call a month. To switch, log in, open Account, then Plan, and click \"Switch to Pro\". The page shows the exact amount before you pay. When you move up, you pay only the difference for the days left in your current period, and your next payment is the new price. You can read more at https://kitebridge.example/help/switch and https://kitebridge.example/plans.\n\nKitebridge Support",
